    "# Quiz: Postscript: Machine learning in the real world\n",
    "\n",
    "> **On Alps:** These are the questions of this lesson's pre-lecture and post-lecture quizzes, from the course's quiz app, with the answers the quiz app accepts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pre-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-9-1-pre-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What's an example of an ML application in the Finance industry?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Personalizing the customer journey using NLP</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Personalizing the customer journey with NLP is a retail example, not a finance one.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Wealth management using linear regression</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. In finance, linear regression helps show how a fund performs compared to a benchmark.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Energy management using Time Series</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Energy management is not a finance example. The finance examples are credit card fraud detection and wealth management.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-9-1-pre-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What ML technique can hospitals use to manage readmission?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Clustering</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Clustering helps find groups of readmissions that may share a common cause.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Time Series</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Hospital readmission is managed with clustering, which finds groups of readmissions with a common cause.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>NLP</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Hospital readmission is managed with clustering, which finds groups of readmissions with a common cause.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-9-1-pre-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What is an example of using Time Series for energy management?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Motion sensing animals</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Motion sensing of animals is not an energy example. In the lesson, sheep postures were studied with classifier algorithms.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Smart parking meters</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. The time series lessons used smart parking meters, and smart metering helps predict future energy use.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Tracking forest fires</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Tracking forest fires is an example of reinforcement learning, not time series.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
