   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-9-1-post-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Which ML technique can be used to detect credit card fraud?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Regression</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Fraud detection uses k-means clustering to sort transactions by how much they look like outliers.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Clustering</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. K-means clustering groups transactions by how much of an outlier each one appears to be.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>NLP</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Fraud detection uses k-means clustering to sort transactions by how much they look like outliers.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"mlb-quiz-9-1-post-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
